"following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Alplox","id":42575576,"login":"Alplox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTc1NTc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alplox/mis-recursos-webdev/commits/583c6459a760c93c9277ccf0ae0f8ea286ddd9a5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-10T00:15:03Z","email":"42575576+Alplox@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alplox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-10T00:15:03Z","email":"42575576+Alplox@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alplox"},"message":"perf: optimize performance and accessibility with lazy loading & minification\n\nAdd astro-critters and @playform/compress integrations for critical CSS inlining and asset minification.\n\nKey changes:\n- Implement lazy loading of search module (only imported on first search)\n- Refactor card rendering for progressive rendering (first 3 grids sync, rest via requestAnimationFrame)\n- Add dynamic contain-intrinsic-size calculations for better content-visibility stability\n- Improve mobile sidebar toggle logic\n- Add 40x40px touch targets to all interactive buttons\n- Add staggered animation delays for card entries\n- Restrict link-card hover effects to hover-capable devices\n- Add comprehensive prefers-reduced-motion support\n- Update Astro to ^7.0 and add minification pipeline\n\nThese changes improve LCP, layout stability, and accessibility while reducing bundle size through lazy loading and compression.","tree":{"sha":"2c0064f4cd78ea74574c10f009662de4b484a7f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alplox/mis-recursos-webdev/git/trees/2c0064f4cd78ea74574c10f009662de4b484a7f2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alplox/mis-recursos-webdev/git/commits/583c6459a760c93c9277ccf0ae0f8ea286ddd9a5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/42575576?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Alplox","id":42575576,"login":"Alplox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQyNTc1NTc2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alplox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Alplox/mis-recursos-webdev/commit/583c6459a760c93c9277ccf0ae0f8ea286ddd9a5","node_id":"C_kwDOFXr-jtoAKDU4M2M2NDU5YTc2MGM5M2M5Mjc3Y2NmMGFlMGY4ZWEyODZkZGQ5YTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Alplox/mis-recursos-webdev/commit/6e9c0818223f5938b86e7456762d31f28135bf3b","sha":"6e9c0818223f5938b86e7456762d31f28135bf3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alplox/mis-recursos-webdev/commits/6e9c0818223f5938b86e7456762d31f28135bf3b"}],"sha":"583c6459a760c93c9277ccf0ae0f8ea286ddd9a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alplox/mis-recursos-webdev/commits/583c6459a760c93c9277ccf0ae0f8ea286ddd9a5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https